    <briefdescription>
<para>A struct containing all of the function pointers needed to perform secure element MAC operations. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>PSA Crypto API implementations should populate the table as appropriate upon startup.</para><para>If one of the functions is not implemented (such as <computeroutput>psa_drv_se_mac_generate_t</computeroutput>), it should be set to NULL.</para><para>Driver implementers should ensure that they implement all of the functions that make sense for their hardware, and that they provide a full solution (for example, if they support <computeroutput>p_setup</computeroutput>, they should also support <computeroutput>p_update</computeroutput> and at least one of <computeroutput>p_finish</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>p_finish_verify</computeroutput>). </para>    </detaileddescription>
